- The exact arcade entry formations, dive curves, and tractor-beam timing are approximated.
- Multiple simultaneous captured fighters and some edge-case dual-fighter interactions are simplified.
- Challenge-stage enemy patterns are approximated rather than arcade-exact.
- Sound effects are synthesized approximations, not exact arcade audio.
- The stage-badge display and high-score persistence use simplified arcade-like behavior.
